cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fanbase-cli, please cite it as below."
title: "fanbase-cli: the command-line client for the Fanbase registry of Fandango input specifications"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The Fandango Fuzzer Team"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/fandango-fuzzer/fanbase-cli"
url: "https://github.com/fandango-fuzzer/fanbase-cli"
abstract: >-
  fanbase is the command that browses, installs, checks, evaluates and contributes Fandango input
  specifications (grammars) from a Fanbase registry. This repository is the command; the registry,
  with the specifications, is fanbase.
keywords:
  - fuzzing
  - test generation
  - grammars
  - file formats
  - Fandango
